#: 79e4611d3187446cb834e68173aac7ea 94052209189f4e588a988ab44f8feb78
#: dbd692901e6740f48361ca6306de6137 e23fe7b95d62455db3830e693774207c
msgid "DroneCAN Adapter Setup"
msgstr "DroneCAN 适配器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:7
#: 2d0f0cd269f14f21bc4c48d9d6b0f624 338a7cf759394cb69efd85d10164802e
#: 5df2a80f0eec4129a669f55f03198de3 65986681cc8c4267a8755fcac2cd3f52
#: b5b70289d0524e2387f47604cfd3a636 ba184179477743838b8582a6eb5aa0c2
msgid ""
"These are several ways that a DroneCAN adapter node running AP_Periph can be"
" used and this page is a small selection of the possibilities. These "
"sections should walk you through setting up the autopilot and the node so "
"that they work together."
msgstr ""
"运行 AP_Periph 的 DroneCAN 适配器节点有多种使用方式，本页仅列举部分可能性。以下各节将引导您完成飞控和节点的设置，使其协同工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:9
#: 00d08b9a7caf4094aa4f76e75d225834 0a16b53c5b5249e5b4b8ab31a1ecc554
#: 16af64ae1cc34735942ef9b247afeb88 495e8a93ebcc462c9712f48cf1e3fcf8
#: 6b90588f7a34474c8e951f79ed6d199e 750a0b9ed6cb4765a9d24d8a09da9f4d
msgid ""
"DroneCAN Adapter nodes usually come with firmware that supports a subset of "
"ArduPilot's large peripheral capability. Be sure to check that the firmware "
"supplied supports the peripherals you are attemptime to setup. If not, check"
" the `Firmware <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/>`__  page for "
"possible alternative firmware for that adapter that may have the capability."
msgstr ""
"DroneCAN 适配器节点通常随附支持 ArduPilot 大量外设功能子集的固件。请确认所附固件支持您要配置的外设。如不支持，请查看 `固件 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/>`__ 页面，寻找该适配器是否有具备相关功能的替代固件。"

