msgstr "设置 :ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` = 8（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:29
#: 091bda2488554f378f6b6373a9540f79 464524a4bda94ef09b7dc2577b5290bb
#: 5637de818d8e47e78fa124186985bd03 888c6133f82a403fac67c03f2ca675a3
