"sensor connected."
msgstr "将 DroneCAN 的 ``ARSPD_TYPE`` 参数设置为匹配所连接的空速传感器类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:32
#: 0332b2dca6644ca08b81cd5be526d4cb 144dd3b031e7456fb4bd1f8bbf0d46d2
#: 4108e7a553ff432e95d1c6587777ad1c 5c88ee65f2344717977d8e614c7dbfb3
#: 6513da1d9a424273ba4fda0174eb4061 a607815d90da4269b2c33b12e5b63a66
msgid "Rangefinder Setup"
msgstr "测距仪设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:33
#: 072d348a6e1a46d985a47d3ed944dab1 3c04ceefd47a4a0cae8d58128079aecf
#: 65240e4889184a59b60ccac31acfb329 9693ef6361a246659c582c66d1260ff4
#: bb79449b775a424c92d6e5609cb24607 d783786646884bff8be1079ced909699
msgid ""
"To use rangefinders, follow the instructions at  :ref:`DroneCAN Setup "
"Advanced<common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` to set up the ArduPilot parameters. "
"Using MissionPlanner or DroneCAN Gui, set the parameters on the adaptor node"
" following the instructions for the relevant rangefinder."
msgstr ""
"要使用测距仪，请按照 :ref:`DroneCAN 高级设置<common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` 中的说明配置 "
"ArduPilot 参数。使用 MissionPlanner 或 DroneCAN GUI，按照相应测距仪的说明在适配器节点上设置参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:35
#: 05450d9784d7486fb637edc2c45f7307 16e578e30a514cc29a7bd9c7ccfef96d
#: 3d16e5c2452446aeb9ff83b645fa616a 3fb92f3f49d14fe3b8de5dc237c70572
#: 859d7f2fd9d64466ada3ceb192f9e7d4 a79fdc2e2f9e44d6b1414108184f4ff1
msgid ""
"The orientation of the rangefinder (RNGFND1_ORIENT) must be set to 0 on the "
"adaptor node."
msgstr "测距仪的方向（RNGFND1_ORIENT）必须在适配器节点上设置为 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:37
#: 2f1c4891bcfa4d5aad2ac4f33b38f6d9 34bde34d4c4f4004a0ccb40c38dd8c89
#: 39d3c8f6be3a49d68ca5adee00ef34ad 43a14e1adec6491087eb5fc3d8824578
#: ced91e6b4b564fd4b5f221bece1f94b9 f23898ea7b384fa8863201d6726d4c51
msgid ""
"The RNGFNDx_ADDR ArduPilot parameter must be set above 0 and be equal to the"
" number set on the DroneCAN adapter node."
msgstr "ArduPilot 中的 RNGFNDx_ADDR 参数必须设置为大于 0 且等于 DroneCAN 适配器节点上设置的编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:40
#: 14fe77b70f524eceb5d520eaa8e2a62a 418e977698c14affad882ae8cd1b6a44
#: 7947ea4f05a3487097578163d09333ea 9d0d7d8d02454c618646deb83e42ada8
#: b8f7706a35c84cdcb370c8b05b76d5e2 f87450cff12c4a0a936d254b2f059f53
msgid "PWM or DShot Output Node"
msgstr "PWM 或 DShot 输出节点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:41
#: 5584648de3704857bf03630a88466a02 91494ae7112043398e93b77f3182c31b
#: 9d978c9fb90b42158ed942eb05c93dda a3919dd6d1b9468a80a1c6abbc70c508
#: f57310b6b65c47b59c6fea364282fc77 ff9cfb0d736445f09ba6907447b876c3
msgid ""
"Adapters that have timer outputs available can be used as PWM and DShot "
"output nodes."
msgstr "具有定时器输出的适配器可用作 PWM 和 DShot 输出节点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:43
#: 2f752fdb17bb41d79f51f23b53725329 6ddff55d95f44dee8da25c2deafa1587
#: 6eecee07f6244b98a7cea90d86903288 9083520bbe3a4002b3415822e8c5ec06
#: a917e18b8e2e494a96508261191115bc cbeceb6aff3a4ca68b3ccb7aa687c1e9
msgid ""
"The `MatekL431 DroneCAN PWM device "
"<https://www.mateksys.com/?portfolio=can-l4-pwm>`__ is an example of this."
msgstr ""
"`MatekL431 DroneCAN PWM 设备 "
"<https://www.mateksys.com/?portfolio=can-l4-pwm>`__ 是一个示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:45
#: 7286b0a1cb264006a3775ea66fd3f480 8d9d58e55fab4e65b769d28ac79091f8
#: 905a66db2c5e43338293e7718e7a8616 bcb17a9de32648dda9210ffd2a4f7ca5
#: e6a4f404ba9349a98cc3a6cfc43f608c e6fcc1ce22514d4eb512c7b9c85e2674
msgid ""
"This can be useful for providing additional servo outputs beyond what the "
"autopilot provides, but is most useful for allowing the ESCs and Sevos to be"
" remotely located, far from the autopilot using the CAN bus to communicate. "
"A maximum of 32 outputs in ArduPilot is possible."
msgstr ""
"这对于在飞控提供的舵机输出之外增加额外输出很有用，但最主要的用途是允许 ESC 和舵机远离飞控，通过 CAN 总线进行通信。ArduPilot 最多支持"
" 32 路输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:47
#: 1decf952a5b74a108bf1b2776ceab28e 3bd4d95ce2e643caa567b9df0fadc7c4
#: 48c31917854c4f4e8308e0fdf48615ee 5a4df525aee5454fbf48676bcf900014
#: a590c674e679420f89a93616ce5ef3d3 a5ff1df64f8a47d0938442dd9d23efe8
msgid ""
"In addition, the autopilot outputs can be configured for GPIO use, and still"
" allow up to 32 servo/motor outputs to be realized with DroneCAN "
"peripherals."
msgstr "此外，飞控输出可以配置为 GPIO 用途，同时仍允许通过 DroneCAN 外设实现多达 32 路舵机/电机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:49
#: 0ee769a8643a412091643b23acbfa792 2889456213984bbdb3051484b6797844
#: 49f8206991d04751805a882bd2638896 6774da25e93841efa08aa07951ada96a
#: 76c1adb0845541348bcf480b71c57127 a6d152501c9249e687e5016887b651b8
msgid ""
"In order to use DShot output, the node must have a DShot-capable firmware "
"installed."
msgstr "要使用 DShot 输出，节点必须安装支持 DShot 的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:52
#: 1a64be4969d34b01ab70c1aa6c537804 2f8160ff9e284c5aa5191637c447ede4
#: 3856daeaeac64186a52488b12e90c6ea 43d84c38776a4b63a6c4902508bce669
#: 6b95a8f7d98347fe99dfa92f86d42263 e5b0479e2e124c69b09738b7c68b7b11
msgid "DShot ESC Adapter"
msgstr "DShot ESC 适配器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ap-periph-usage-examples.rst:53
#: 40dfc504de3a49fda29d983bf32a8db7 75a335cc97624aa596cd856d02798918
#: 98e50bc3aea54a979fcb87782d9139d1 ac6bb70b250e4ab6aa6fcbb691280219
#: bb10429149874ab5a77dca9b06fea43f c9795178052a4901ac2dac4f39e4ade7
msgid ""
"In this example, a quadplane with outputs 5-8 used for 4 DShot ESCs with "
"telemetry will be shown. 3 wires from each ESC should be connected to the "
"DroneCAN adapter node: Ground, DShot signal, and serial telemetry. The "
"ground from each ESC should be connected to a ground pad on the DroneCAN "
"node. The signal wires from the 4 ESCs should be connected to the first 4 "
"PWM pads on the node, marked as outputs “1”, “2”, “3”, and “4”. The serial "
"telemetry pin from all 4 ESCs should be all connected to the same UART RX "
"pin on the adapter node."
msgstr ""
"本示例展示一架使用输出 5-8 连接 4 个带数传 DShot ESC 的四旋翼固定翼飞机。每个 ESC 的 3 根线应连接到 DroneCAN "
"适配器节点：地线、DShot 信号线和串口数传线。每个 ESC 的地线应连接到 DroneCAN 节点上的地焊盘。4 个 ESC "
"的信号线应分别连接到节点上标记为 「1」、「2」、「3」、「4」 的前 4 个 PWM 焊盘。所有 4 个 ESC "
"的串口数传引脚应全部连接到适配器节点上的同一个 UART RX 引脚。"

